  "goodToKnow": "Das Bildnis is a portrait or likeness, a literary or art-historical word: das Bildnis eines jungen Mannes, Dürers Selbstbildnis. Everyday German says das Porträt. Du sollst dir kein Bildnis machen (thou shalt not make any graven image) is from the Ten Commandments, and Max Frisch used it to argue we shouldn't fix fixed images of others. Plural: die Bildnisse."
